  "@type": "DefinedTermSet",
  "name": "Life event",
  "description": "The circumstances a service relates to. People look for government services by what is happening to them - having a baby, losing a job, moving home - not by the department that happens to run them, which is why the EU Single Digital Gateway organises services this way. Deliberately coarse and universal: the department that issues a birth certificate differs everywhere, the fact of a birth does not.",
